  "question": {
    "text": "If the sum of the coefficients in the expansion of <math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup></math> lies between <math><mn>4000</mn></math> and <math><mn>10000</mn><mo>,</mo></math> then the value of the greatest coefficient must be",
